@startuml
actor Operador
participant "React" as Web
participant "Express API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Socket.IO" as Socket
actor Administrador as Admin

Operador -> Web : preenche solicitação
Web -> API : POST /auth/register
API -> DB : cria User(PENDING) + token hash
DB --> API : commit
API --> Web : 202 + trackingToken
Web -> Socket : registration:watch(token)
Socket -> DB : valida token hash e status
Socket --> Web : acompanhamento ativo
Socket --> Admin : registration:requested
Admin -> API : PATCH /admin/users/:id/approve
API -> DB : User=ACTIVE + audit log
DB --> API : commit
API -> Socket : registration:approved
Socket --> Web : status ACTIVE
Web --> Operador : aprovado; ir para login
@enduml

